{"3805400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bonds of the Zodiac", "steam_appid": 3805400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonds of the Zodiac</strong> is a first-person narrative adventure where you play as <strong>Rei</strong>, a girl left alone after the passing of her grandmother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/72444e1e63f3efb59ae2880b249723d6.poster.avif?t=1787965178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/72444e1e63f3efb59ae2880b249723d6.webm?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/72444e1e63f3efb59ae2880b249723d6.mp4?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rei gets contacted by the spirits of Zodiac, asking her for help with breaking their bond with the Jade Emperor, who keeps them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To free them, Rei must explore a mystical world, solve light environmental puzzles, and help the Zodiac spirits confront their personal struggles and sever the spiritual bonds that keep them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/0bcdd36e6f22de82e1e6b608f8e2c0de.poster.avif?t=1787965178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/0bcdd36e6f22de82e1e6b608f8e2c0de.webm?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/0bcdd36e6f22de82e1e6b608f8e2c0de.mp4?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a <strong>beautiful rural Japanese village</strong> and cross into <strong>mystical realms</strong> tied to the Zodiac and the Jade Emperor. The game's visuals shift between grounded reality and colorful spiritual dreamscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/6e584d321d7d7eab4935aabbe35d78e1.poster.avif?t=1787965178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/6e584d321d7d7eab4935aabbe35d78e1.webm?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/6e584d321d7d7eab4935aabbe35d78e1.mp4?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/a1507f4cfc8ae51214f5888ad383c052.poster.avif?t=1787965178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/a1507f4cfc8ae51214f5888ad383c052.webm?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/a1507f4cfc8ae51214f5888ad383c052.mp4?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relationships &amp; Bonds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/778cd7768679f1e26eef58b3df627a4b.poster.avif?t=1787965178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/778cd7768679f1e26eef58b3df627a4b.webm?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/778cd7768679f1e26eef58b3df627a4b.mp4?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the twelve <strong>Zodiac spirits</strong> and uncover their emotional conflicts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about their ties to the Jade Emperor and help them find resolution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/8aeba2bd7cafe95cd26a3f607019b560.poster.avif?t=1787965178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/8aeba2bd7cafe95cd26a3f607019b560.webm?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/8aeba2bd7cafe95cd26a3f607019b560.mp4?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonds appear as <strong>tangible strings</strong>—find ways to sever them and guide the spirits toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.5 to 2.5 hours</strong> of emotionally driven storytelling</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration and light puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue choices that shape Rei’s relationships and story arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, melancholic, and tense music tracks that evolve with the narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>A free demo is available now! Try it and experience the world of Bonds of the Zodiac.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonds of the Zodiac</strong> is a first-person narrative adventure where you play as <strong>Rei</strong>, a girl left alone after the passing of her grandmother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/72444e1e63f3efb59ae2880b249723d6.poster.avif?t=1787965178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/72444e1e63f3efb59ae2880b249723d6.webm?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/72444e1e63f3efb59ae2880b249723d6.mp4?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rei gets contacted by the spirits of Zodiac, asking her for help with breaking their bond with the Jade Emperor, who keeps them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To free them, Rei must explore a mystical world, solve light environmental puzzles, and help the Zodiac spirits confront their personal struggles and sever the spiritual bonds that keep them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/0bcdd36e6f22de82e1e6b608f8e2c0de.poster.avif?t=1787965178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/0bcdd36e6f22de82e1e6b608f8e2c0de.webm?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/0bcdd36e6f22de82e1e6b608f8e2c0de.mp4?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a <strong>beautiful rural Japanese village</strong> and cross into <strong>mystical realms</strong> tied to the Zodiac and the Jade Emperor. The game's visuals shift between grounded reality and colorful spiritual dreamscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/6e584d321d7d7eab4935aabbe35d78e1.poster.avif?t=1787965178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/6e584d321d7d7eab4935aabbe35d78e1.webm?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/6e584d321d7d7eab4935aabbe35d78e1.mp4?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/a1507f4cfc8ae51214f5888ad383c052.poster.avif?t=1787965178\" width=