tem_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/8aeba2bd7cafe95cd26a3f607019b560.mp4?t=1787965178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonds appear as <strong>tangible strings</strong>—find ways to sever them and guide the spirits toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.5 to 2.5 hours</strong> of emotionally driven storytelling</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration and light puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue choices that shape Rei’s relationships and story arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, melancholic, and tense music tracks that evolve with the narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>A free demo is available now! Try it and experience the world of Bonds of the Zodiac.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Rei, a grieving girl, is drawn into a mystical realm where the Zodiac spirits are bound by the Jade Emperor. Mediate their inner struggles and guide them toward freedom in a first-person journey steeped in myth, conflict, and emotion.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/90806e3a41de96df63f4e307fa2bee9f8b28b613/header.jpg?t=1787965178", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/59d4544c83ae0bcde6e804a7249ff88307aa36a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787965178", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/59d4544c83ae0bcde6e804a7249ff88307aa